* AuraVox AFE sEMG - subcircuitos (valores: docs/afe-emg/AFE_valores_ltspice.md)
* Nombres de componentes siguen la pizarra del 26-sep.
.include models/INA333.LIB
* modelo de op-amp: el archivo de prueba incluye models/opa_behav.lib o models/opa_mcp.lib
.model D1N4148 D(Is=2.52n Rs=.568 N=1.752 Cjo=4p M=.4 tt=20n)

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Un canal: electrodos (EP, EN) -> ADC
* RGM = punto medio de RG (sensado de modo comun para el RLD)
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt AFE_CH EP EN VCC VREF ADC RGM INAOUT
+ params: Rs=100k Rrfi=1k Ccm=47p Cd=100p RG=5.22k
+ Chp=100n R1hp=56.2k Rahp=113k
+ Rf=240k Rg2=10k Cg=10u
+ Rla=88.7k C11=3.9n C12=3.3n
+ Rlb=54.9k C21=15n C22=2.2n
+ Rbk=100 Cbk=1n
* Proteccion ESD
Rsp EP P1 {Rs}
Rsn EN N1 {Rs}
Dp1 P1 VCC D1N4148
Dp2 0 P1 D1N4148
Dn1 N1 VCC D1N4148
Dn2 0 N1 D1N4148
* Filtro RFI
Rfp P1 P2 {Rrfi}
Rfn N1 N2 {Rrfi}
Ccmp P2 0 {Ccm}
Ccmn N2 0 {Ccm}
Cdif P2 N2 {Cd}
* INA333 (IN+ IN- VCC VEE OUT REF RG+ RG-), RG partido en dos
XINA P2 N2 VCC 0 INAOUT VREF RGP RGN INA333
RGa RGP RGM {RG/2}
RGb RGM RGN {RG/2}
* HPF Sallen-Key 2o orden, ganancia 1 (C, C, R1: nodo->salida, Ra: V+ -> VREF)
Chp1 INAOUT HA {Chp}
Chp2 HA HB {Chp}
R1 HA HPO {R1hp}
Ra HB VREF {Rahp}
XHP HB HPO VCC 0 HPO OPA
* G2 no inversor: G_AC = 1+Rf/Rg, G_DC = 1 (Cg retorna a VREF)
XG2 HPO G2N VCC 0 G2O OPA
Rf G2O G2N {Rf}
Rg G2N GC {Rg2}
Cg GC VREF {Cg}
* LPF A Sallen-Key, Q = 0.541
Rla1 G2O LA {Rla}
Rla2 LA LB {Rla}
C11 LA LAO {C11}
C12 LB 0 {C12}
XLA LB LAO VCC 0 LAO OPA
* LPF B Sallen-Key, Q = 1.306
Rlb1 LAO LC {Rlb}
Rlb2 LC LD {Rlb}
C21 LC LBO {C21}
C22 LD 0 {C22}
XLB LD LBO VCC 0 LBO OPA
* Buffer + bucket al ADC
XBF LBO BUF VCC 0 BUF OPA
Rbk BUF ADC {Rbk}
Cbk ADC 0 {Cbk}
.ends AFE_CH

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Electrodo: media celda DC + Re || Ce
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt ELECTRODE SKIN LEAD params: Vhc=0 Re=20k Ce=47n
Vhc SKIN X {Vhc}
Re X LEAD {Re}
Ce X LEAD {Ce}
.ends ELECTRODE

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* VREF: divisor 2x100k + 10u, seguidor
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt VREFGEN VCC VREF
RA1 VCC VD 100k
RA2 VD 0 100k
CA VD 0 10u
XVR VD VREF VCC 0 VREF OPA
.ends VREFGEN
